      "source": "By default, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/net/HttpCookie.html#parse(java.lang.String)\" title=\"class or interface in java.net\"><code>HttpCookie.parse(String)</code></a> is used, and\nadditionally the sameSite attribute is parsed and set.",
